ok - a fresh task worktree is registered in Pi's own trust store
ok - registration records the canonical worktree path Pi itself would key on
ok - an existing registration is idempotent and leaves every other entry untouched
ok - a new registration preserves every existing trust entry
ok - a recorded 'Do not trust' decision refuses the spawn instead of being reversed
ok - a trusted ancestor counts as already trusted and writes nothing
ok - an undecided ancestor entry is skipped and the nearest recorded decision wins
