ok - an unwritable store fails loudly and leaves nothing behind
ok - a malformed store fails loudly instead of being rewritten
ok - a non-boolean trust value fails loudly instead of being silently rewritten
ok - primary checkouts, subdirectories, plain directories, unrelated worktrees, home, /, and relative roots are refused
ok - the store root follows the pinned agent dir and else ~/.pi/agent, never the invoking environment
ok - pi ship spawn registers its worktree before launch
ok - pi-signed ship spawn registers its worktree before launch
ok - an unpinned pi spawn registers Pi's default store even when the spawn environment names another root
